Comment: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.39,0:00:12.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.41,0:00:14.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:18.59,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,{May I come in?}{Anyone home?}Excuse me!{Our viewers will hear them say "gomen", need to have "sorry" or "excuse me" in there.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:19.17,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:20.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:29.14,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:31.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, all of a sudden{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:33.55,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Rin-chan~!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:34.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:35.95,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.95,0:00:38.59,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here, Reina-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:40.42,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going somewhere else later?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:40.42,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.42,0:00:42.26,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No, Reina's here to play with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:43.89,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:43.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.89,0:00:46.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan, do you like sweet buns? {amashOKu 甘食}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:47.22,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.22,0:00:48.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a round-shaped snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.94,0:00:49.86,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Then, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:53.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well then Rin, go get Reina-chan some barley tea.{mugicha 麦茶}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.07,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK. Let's go, Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.07,0:00:57.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We were just having snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.33,0:00:59.07,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Reina wants to eat, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:40.24,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:41.19,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:43.07,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,This is my first time eating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.97,0:02:48.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.67,0:02:49.94,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:51.39,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.39,0:02:53.98,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Even though this is my first time here, it feels just like Grandpa's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.98,0:02:55.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, what's going on, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.35,0:02:57.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've got a pretty big bag just for a Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:02:59.12,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:02.31,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Actually we... {\alpha&FFFFFF&}ran away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.31,0:03:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually we... ran away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.43,0:03:04.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.63,0:03:06.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Your family will be worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.57,0:03:08.10,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you do that anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:11.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.65,0:03:13.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is it because of "that"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.11,0:03:14.41,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's "that"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.41,0:03:16.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"That" is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did your husband and you....
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:18.84,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's also partly that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:20.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Also?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:21.14,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Also!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you and your mother-in-law...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.74,0:03:25.54,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's also part of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:31.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,S-Seems like it's really tough living together with your husband and in-laws.  {Added the "husband", as it's said in the audio. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.56,0:03:36.53,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of which, does a family that gets along well with the in-laws even exist in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:38.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Frightening!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:42.93,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have any siblings either, so I've got nowhere else to go.{Having "I don't have any" twice in one sentence was bizzare}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.77,0:03:42.93,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, your math textbook is the same as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.93,0:03:44.64,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.93,0:03:44.64,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Can I stay over at your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:48.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You have to properly talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:50.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about your in-laws?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.73,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let me see your other ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.73,0:03:47.91,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:51.42,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,The Japanese Language textbook is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:53.39,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right. I already left a letter there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:53.39,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Let Reina see yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:55.22,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:55.22,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,But I didn't mention where I would be staying at.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:58.09,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be the one to send Reina to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:04:00.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,The rest... I haven't thought much about it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:02.14,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't told my parents yet. {Shorten please ^^ -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:03.63,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haven't thought about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You even brought your kid along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.13,0:04:06.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:09.04,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,But there's no helping it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:11.61,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I only wanted to leave that place as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.61,0:04:12.96,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's only by one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.93,0:04:17.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:20.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, let's go buy ingredients for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.27,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:26.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The room at the right is completely empty. Both of you can use it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:26.24,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's true. They are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:32.19,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot. It's a bit heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:34.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What exactly did you stuff inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:38.35,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina's slippers and textbooks are inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.35,0:04:40.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty incredible of you to run over here with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:47.29,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You probably eat "that" normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:49.36,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll cook you something proper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:50.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't eat "that".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:53.88,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can we go and look at some snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:55.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, but one of each only.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:57.71,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.71,0:05:00.09,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Which type of meat should I choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:03.11,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They're all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:04.38,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That won't do. This one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.27,0:05:07.35,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,But... this one is also...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:14.02,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi-san, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:17.36,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, this meat is so cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.36,0:05:19.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:23.61,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, this isn't what you think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:27.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Her name is Haruko; a cousin from my mother's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.15,0:05:29.97,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Does it matter which side I'm from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:30.70,Default-Alt,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,I-I see, so that's who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:31.88,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.15,0:05:37.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I blabbering like an idiot when she didn't even ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:35.75,Default-Alt,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,My son and Rin-chan are good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.01,0:05:40.69,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, what position am I in that I have to be explaining myself to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:42.22,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's with "it's not what you think it is"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:44.68,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,My name's Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:46.06,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She's already a first year elementary school student starting this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.68,0:05:46.06,Default-Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.21,0:05:48.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:50.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What snack did you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.03,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi. I got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:55.03,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,DX Big Nyan Gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:57.16,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mine is vegetable sponge cakes. {kasutera　かすてら }
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:06:00.47,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Reina got Nyan Nyan Kororin mascot's candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:05.14,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Is that really a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.17,0:06:14.17,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}She's a really beautiful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.17,0:06:19.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}W-Well, she's beautiful for a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.49,0:06:23.56,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}But I feel it's best not to commit adultery.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:25.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Y-You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:27.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}It's totally not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:30.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Besides, there's only Kouki and her in the family. It's tough for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:31.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I never once thought of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:32.56,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Both?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.56,0:06:35.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You moron! You've watched too many weird soap dramas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:38.47,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She's at most only older than us by two or three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.47,0:06:40.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,H-How do I know how old she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:44.32,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, she probably divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:47.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not very sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:52.02,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.02,0:06:54.15,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I've never eaten this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:56.26,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I tried cooking something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:59.96,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Normally, I always prioritise my mother-in-law's favourite food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:03.10,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, make this at home too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.44,0:07:07.94,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,All right then, itadakimasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:09.64,Default,Trio,0000,0000,0000,,Itadakimasu~!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:11.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:13.15,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Why thank you, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.15,0:07:15.50,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina, hold your chopsticks properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.61,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:20.29,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,The floor is making squishy squishy sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.59,0:07:21.37,Default-Alt,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough Reina, take this towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:22.43,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:23.67,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:25.13,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, a bra~
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:28.23,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina! Stop pulling so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:38.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She fell asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:40.57,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:42.91,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Both of them are too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.91,0:07:46.04,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I already carried Rin-chan over to your futon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:46.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.{Arigatou. }
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:47.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:47.98,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:53.69,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's great! It's been a long time since I had beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:55.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.02,0:07:57.31,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I've become fat recently, so forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:07:58.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:01.16,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What? Have I really grown fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:04.93,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's very normal for a thirty year old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:08.35,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,After approaching thirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.35,0:08:10.81,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Everything changes once you hit thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:12.66,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'd better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.66,0:08:15.86,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Though I say this, my husband doesn't even look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:18.22,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Who am I working so hard for to maintain this figure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:24.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:24.97,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.97,0:08:29.01,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When you two were taking a bath just now, I gave a call to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:30.62,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What? Why did you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.62,0:08:33.03,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm warning you, don't do weird things, Dai-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.03,0:08:34.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's weird about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:36.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They'll be worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:38.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I only told them that both of you are doing fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:41.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and that you're only staying at my house temporarily. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:43.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even mention my address.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:45.65,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I already left a letter before running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:46.64,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Mind your own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:48.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm fine with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:50.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But the problem is Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:52.46,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina is with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:54.02,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She's also really healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:54.81,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:09:01.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, if you don't tell them properly where Reina is, even if she's healthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:05.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think anyone waiting won't know she's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:07.25,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Why bother thinking about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:09.48,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down a bit, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:10.63,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.73,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're only trying to make them worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:17.47,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.74,0:09:23.99,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,This is Reina's nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.19,0:09:29.68,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa and Mama are always fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:31.33,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Even though they're married?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:36.05,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, even though they are married. Reina always pretends to sleep by burying herself in the blanket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:39.56,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Let's hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:42.14,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's itchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:43.75,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.07,0:09:50.06,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I... day after day...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:55.65,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I have been hiding my feelings ever since I got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.65,0:09:59.04,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with making them worried for a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:05.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:07.69,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying strange things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.69,0:10:08.55,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:11.14,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.14,0:10:12.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:19.96,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:38.42,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:40.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:54.97,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.97,0:10:56.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.43,0:10:58.03,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.03,0:11:00.13,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you making breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.13,0:11:00.83,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:02.76,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:04.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're up rather early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.44,0:11:05.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.88,0:11:07.60,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey Dai-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.60,0:11:09.37,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You have Rin-chan make breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:11.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,D-Don't take me for an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.18,0:11:13.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's always been the two of us making breakfast together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.62,0:11:15.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When it's time to use the stove, I{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.42,0:11:16.82,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Get along with each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:23.17,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Come look at you, the rice are all over your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.17,0:11:24.40,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Eh~?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.40,0:11:26.70,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:28.93,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to take the train to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.87,0:11:32.57,Default-Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan~! Rin-chan~!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:32.57,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it this early?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.57,0:11:33.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:34.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I hear you already!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:36.18,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop shouting and just come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:37.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're disturbing the neighbours!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:39.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, is your school very far?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.89,0:11:41.03,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Going off so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:41.78,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:47.19,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's mother is too busy, so he comes over to our place in the morning first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:51.09,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.09,0:11:53.25,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you got married!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:55.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I did not! She's my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:56.72,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:11:58.02,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You're not married, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:00.33,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "after all"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:02.50,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, do you want to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?  No... That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:07.04,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, being single is better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.88,0:12:10.74,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's a single?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:12.39,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Means not marrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.39,0:12:14.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know, it's divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:16.48,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what's a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:21.47,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan's mother, who's married, thinks being single is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:24.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, who's single, thinks getting married is better?{These two lines are win :D -sm}{These lines are worded perfectly, exactly the way a little kid would talk.-AE}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:26.49,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Grown-ups are so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:28.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, they are weird indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:33.61,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can I have some rice balls?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You have eaten, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:37.04,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:38.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Fine then, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.44,0:12:39.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's my portion, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.78,0:12:41.12,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.11,0:12:44.07,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't you have breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:46.82,Default-Alt,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you eating here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:46.82,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Just how nice a guy do you want to be, Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:48.94,Default-Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:48.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? It's just a rice ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:51.05,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not referring to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.05,0:12:54.02,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You're also very busy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.02,0:12:57.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That beautiful mother, you're indeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.89,0:13:00.29,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Id-Id-You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:01.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're going on about that again!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.09,0:13:06.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I only want lend her a helping hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.66,0:13:09.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Rin and the both of them are rather close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.40,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}But it's only that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:16.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I don't really know the details, but Kouki and his mother definitely went through some rough patches.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:19.84,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be very rude of me to probe too much into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.32,0:13:25.78,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I guess being a single mother is really tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:30.40,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina! Didn't I say that you'll be late if you don't hurry up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:31.96,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Mama's going on ahead, you know.{Edit plox to a better thing. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:30.90,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.96,0:13:34.17,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.17,0:13:35.43,Default,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.43,0:13:37.82,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Keep it a secret that we're staying at someone's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:39.67,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,What? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:41.67,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't ask why, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.67,0:13:42.63,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yes~!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.63,0:13:43.72,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:45.08,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:47.36,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,You came with your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.36,0:13:48.84,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:50.55,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Because we ran away from home secretly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.55,0:13:52.42,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,So we took the train today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:55.31,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,What? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:21.27,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,No, stop! Hey~!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.27,0:14:24.21,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I tell you to hold onto it tightly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.21,0:14:27.20,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be gotten back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.35,0:14:31.88,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,But it could have flew back to its home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.03,0:14:35.37,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.26,0:14:42.92,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.92,0:14:44.70,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? You're pretty late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.70,0:14:47.00,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, my family is helping to look after my kid.{Can't use "him" as a pronoun, no subject has been established}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:48.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is Yuu-kun doing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.67,0:14:50.26,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, never been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:54.11,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,He's so lively recently that even I can't handle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:57.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But isn't it great that your husband is willing to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.27,0:14:58.86,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,This is only the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.86,0:15:01.89,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,He just happened to be back from a business trip and is taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.89,0:15:06.58,Default,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, husbands can't be counted on to raise a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:09.62,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:11.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Reina-chan is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:12.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.14,0:15:33.04,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1200)}I'm back, Reina-chan~!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:42.22,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She fell asleep very quickly today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:46.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko, you're not thinking of making this into a big deal, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.93,0:15:51.84,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are you referring to a divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.84,0:15:53.82,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:55.99,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.99,0:15:57.13,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:16:01.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see, I worried for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:04.61,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I have thought about that many times before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:08.51,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Or should I say I think about it almost everyday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:13.82,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I'm seeing my husband as an enemy at their place...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:17.66,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone else is an enemy other than Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:20.29,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I always felt that only both of us are family.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:24.54,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,But you know, divorce is very unrealistic to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.54,0:16:28.60,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thinking about Reina, and my ability to earn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.60,0:16:32.27,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,And divorce comes with many troublesome things before it can be achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.27,0:16:38.30,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,The conclusion I came to is that my current situation seems to be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:42.25,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I decided to get married just after I started working.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:48.19,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Because at that time, all I thought of was how to be a good wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.19,0:16:50.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's only all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.89,0:16:53.50,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This is the only way to protect Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.31,0:16:57.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I've never once thought of getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:00.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But looks like even a normal family is complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:03.73,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You managed to settle everything on your own, that's really impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:04.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:06.74,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even do anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:07.70,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:10.28,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan looks really happy to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.28,0:17:12.64,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She even cooks for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:17.55,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's family is working hard, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.55,0:17:20.15,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine for both Reina and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:21.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've been saying the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:24.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Have you properly talked this over with your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:29.56,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,He's always working overtime. We hardly have any time to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:32.64,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's why, I've to work hard together with Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:36.29,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, I've been enduring it for so many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:38.03,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It shouldn't be a problem in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:42.74,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,As long as I don't think too much, I don't think it's a problem to just carry on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.15,0:17:46.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Very unhealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.04,0:17:47.00,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's the opposite!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:48.71,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Your body will spoil if this were not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:53.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten really strong, Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.41,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:18:00.37,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,When you have a child, you have to develop the courage to help them when the need arises. {may need some rephrasing. It's hard to phrase this TL}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:02.91,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Especially when the child is still a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.93,0:18:07.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I don't really understand when it's still a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:11.04,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,After going through such a lifestyle again and again,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:13.54,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,you sort of slowly change to become like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:16.14,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I hate this, becoming an aunty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.14,0:18:20.08,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I never even thought of becoming strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.51,0:18:26.12,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,If I had a choice, I'd really wish to be a little girl forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:33.07,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Dai-chan. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.07,0:18:35.93,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.93,0:18:37.06,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.87,0:18:42.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just does it mean to be married?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.37,0:18:44.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And what does it mean to become a parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:54.80,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? It's your turn, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:56.17,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.17,0:18:57.60,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:58.43,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.43,0:18:59.42,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's Papa's car.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.53,0:19:04.02,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Your Papa will only come after work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:05.89,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's impossible for him to be here so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.89,0:19:07.71,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,It's definitely Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:09.64,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Reina can't be wrong about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.64,0:19:12.10,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously, I tell you it's not him, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.10,0:19:13.22,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.03,0:19:15.87,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.87,0:19:17.59,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I was so worried, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:19.54,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Reina was also worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.37,0:19:21.52,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:22.86,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:26.22,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's possible for him to come back at such an early time if he wants to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:28.02,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Don't say such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:31.48,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's very tough working at a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.55,0:19:31.48,Default-Alt,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hideyuki-san, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:33.48,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.48,0:19:35.19,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko must have given you lots of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.19,0:19:36.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,N-No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:39.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't do anything much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.49,0:19:41.16,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I didn't even change my clothes. {\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.91,0:19:45.83,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.03,0:19:49.92,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be great if your Papa helps in carrying the luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.92,0:19:51.45,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Not a bit considerate at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:54.30,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, not considerate at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.27,0:19:59.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You can come again any time you feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.71,0:20:03.57,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,How could I? I can't impose on you any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:05.58,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:10.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying Rin wants to meet Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:16.02,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks a lot, Dai-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:19.81,Default,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, why don't we come over on Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.81,0:20:21.40,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:25.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The Haruko who was always crying when she was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:30.37,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The sobbing Haruko yesterday who said she wants to be a girl forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.94,0:20:33.09,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.09,0:20:36.56,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, bring less luggage when you come.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.56,0:20:37.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't bear to see it any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.89,0:20:40.85,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible, impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.85,0:20:43.32,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,A woman always has lots of luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.32,0:20:45.91,Default,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,This amount is nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:45.91,Default-Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.91,0:20:47.42,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll send you two off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.56,0:22:22.95,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.98,0:22:27.19,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,But this one seems to suit Rin-chan more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.19,0:22:27.96,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Look, how's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.96,0:22:30.14,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can I also try this on for a look?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.14,0:22:31.23,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.23,0:22:32.92,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thirsty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:35.60,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Only the fitting is left.{It's only left with the fitting.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.60,0:22:37.97,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,This one looks good too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.97,0:22:41.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Erm... Kouki and I will shop around elsewhere first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.41,0:22:42.94,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Sure~!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.94,0:22:44.91,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Look, it suits you perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.91,0:22:47.10,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan looks so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:53.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.38,0:22:55.15,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,This must be the summer flavour.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:22:58.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:12.03,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k5}{\k13}a{\k52}shi{\k45}ta {\k18}no {\k22}ko{\k25}to {\k21}ha {\k20}{\k20}wa{\k29}ka{\k17}n{\k9}na{\k16}i
