Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:33.47,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Your existence is no longer so important anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:39.60,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k14}{\k24}o{\k26}wa{\k22}ra{\k27}na{\k17}i {\k41}ko{\k41}to {\k36}na{\k12}n{\k16}te {\k24}ko{\k18}no{\k41}yo {\k27}no {\k20}do{\k40}ko{\k27}ni{\k20}mo{\k66}na{\k44}i.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:39.60,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k14}{\k24}終{\k26}わ{\k22}ら{\k27}な{\k17}い{\k41}こ{\k41}と{\k36}な{\k12}ん{\k16}て{\k24}こ{\k18}の{\k41}世{\k27}の{\k20}何{\k40}処{\k27}に{\k20}も{\k66}無{\k44}い。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:39.60,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Things that last forever don't exist anywhere in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:43.82,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k32}{\k24}na{\k23}ku {\k28}no {\k34}ha {\k45}tsu{\k42}ra{\k42}i {\k6}n{\k19}ja, {\k12}na{\k12}i{\k39}no,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:43.82,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k32}{\k24}泣{\k23}く{\k28}の{\k34}は{\k87}辛{\k42}い{\k6}ん{\k19}じゃ、{\k12}な{\k12}い{\k39}の、
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:43.82,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Crying is a very painful thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.82,0:01:46.44,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k12}{\k25}ai {\k38}no{\k13} {\kf34}SWEET {\kf59}DROPS {\kf27}SWEET {\kf54}DROPS
