Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:53.24,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be more gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:56.79,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k36}{\k20}ki{\k27}mi {\k13}{\k31}to {\k18}i{\k20}ra{\k18}re{\k26}ta{\k26}ra,{\k33} {\kf87}HAPPY.
