Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:56.79,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Just being together with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:02:00.21,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k18}{\k25}o{\k28}n{\k58}na{\k22}no{\k40}ko {\k34}tte {\k22}{\k14}tsu{\k17}yo{\k24}i {\k40}ne.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:02:00.21,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k18}{\k111}女{\k22}の{\k40}子{\k34}って{\k22}{\k31}強{\k24}い{\k40}ね。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:02:00.21,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,Girls are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:03.50,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k22}{\k18}da{\k43}ke{\k45}do {\k18}to{\k23}ki{\k21}do{\k25}ki {\k20}{\k22}yo{\k31}wa{\k13}i {\k28}ne.
